<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>報名成功人員公告 · 研討會</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            background: #f5f7fc;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', '微軟正黑體', 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
            padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: flex-start;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1280px;
            width: 100%;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 32px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px -12px rgba(0, 20, 50, 0.2);
            padding: 2rem 2rem 2.5rem;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .header {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            align-items: flex-start;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #e6edf5;
            padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
        }

        .title-section h1 {
            font-size: 2.1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #0b2a4a;
            letter-spacing: -0.01em;
            margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
        }

        .title-section .subhead {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #4a6a85;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.4rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
        }

        .badge {
            background: #e1ebf9;
            color: #1f4a7a;
            padding: 0.25rem 0.9rem;
            border-radius: 40px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
            display: inline-block;
            margin-left: 0.25rem;
        }

        /* 顯著標示：可容納人數 / 剩餘名額 */
        .capacity-alert {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
            background: #fff8e6;
            border: 2px solid #f5c542;
            color: #7a4f00;
            padding: 0.7rem 1.4rem;
            border-radius: 16px;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(245, 197, 66, 0.25);
            margin-top: 0.4rem;
        }

        .capacity-alert .highlight {
            background: #f5c542;
            color: #3d2a00;
            padding: 0.2rem 0.9rem;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        .capacity-alert .remain {
            color: #b33e00;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .source-link {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            background: #f0f5ff;
            padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
            border-radius: 60px;
            transition: background 0.2s;
            word-break: break-all;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        .source-link a {
            color: #1d5b9c;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed #9bb7d4;
        }

        .source-link a:hover {
            color: #0a3460;
            border-bottom-color: #0a3460;
        }

        .meta-info {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
            background: #f9fbfe;
            padding: 0.9rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 18px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: #2b4d6e;
            border: 1px solid #dbe6f0;
        }

        .meta-info span {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .meta-info i {
            font-style: normal;
            font-weight: 500;
            background: #d9e6f5;
            padding: 0.2rem 0.7rem;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #1f4462;
        }

        .table-wrapper {
            overflow-x: auto;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
            border: 1px solid #e2ebf3;
            background: #ffffff;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            min-width: 700px;
        }

        th {
            background: #eef4fb;
            color: #1c3f5e;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-align: left;
            padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.02em;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #cbdae8;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        td {
            padding: 0.85rem 1.2rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e9f0f7;
            color: #203d59;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }

        tr:last-child td {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        tbody tr:hover {
            background: #f5faff;
            transition: background 0.15s;
        }

        .date-col {
            font-family: 'SF Mono', 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #2d577b;
            white-space: nowrap;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .name-col {
            font-weight: 550;
            color: #0f2f4b;
        }

        .unit-col {
            color: #2d4d6e;
        }

        .footer-note {
            margin-top: 1.75rem;
            text-align: right;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #6f8aa5;
            border-top: 1px solid #dee9f2;
            padding-top: 1.2rem;
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .record-count {
            background: #e2edf9;
            padding: 0.3rem 1.1rem;
            border-radius: 40px;
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #16466b;
        }

        .note {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            color: #5a7b98;
        }

        @media (max-width: 650px) {
            body {
                padding: 1rem 0.75rem;
            }

            .container {
                padding: 1.25rem 1rem;
                border-radius: 24px;
            }

            .title-section h1 {
                font-size: 1.65rem;
            }

            .header {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-start;
                gap: 1rem;
            }

            .capacity-alert {
                font-size: 0.95rem;
                padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
            }

            .meta-info {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 0.6rem;
                padding: 0.8rem 1.1rem;
            }

            th, td {
                padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem;
                font-size: 0.85rem;
            }

            .date-col {
                font-size: 0.82rem;
                white-space: nowrap;
            }

            .footer-note {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 0.8rem;
                align-items: flex-start;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- 头部 -->
        <div class="header">
            <div class="title-section">
                <h1>報名成功人員公告</h1>
                <div class="subhead">
                    報名統計日期：10月20日 至 10月29日 · 研討會報名成功清單
                    <span class="badge">共 40 位</span>
                </div>
                <!-- 顯著標示：可容納人數 / 剩餘名額 -->
                <div class="capacity-alert">
                    <span>📌 可容納報名人數：<span class="highlight">60 人</span></span>
                    <span>🪑 剩餘名額：<span class="remain">15 人</span></span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="source-link">
                🔗 資訊來源：
                <a href="https://peter7336959.github.io/seminar/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                    https://peter7336959.github.io/seminar/
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 提示块 -->
